      "version": "1.2.1",
      "title": "AllAuth React SDK 1.2.1: viewport-aware compact menus",
      "summary": "Corrects menu overflow measurements and positioning near viewport edges.",
      "notes": [
        "Measures against document viewport width and updates left/right placement rather than retaining a translated overflow box.",
